      <div type="clause" n="12, 12.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 12, 12.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be oxan | hyrde Oxanhyrde mot læswian .ii. oxan oððe ma mid hlafordes heorde on gemænre læse be his ealdormannes gewitnesse . ear|nian mid ðam scos 7 glofa him sylfum .7 his metecu mot gan mid hlafordes oxan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the oxherd The oxherd may graze two oxen or more with the lord’s herd on the common pasture with the knowledge of his overseer, [and he may] earn with them shoes and gloves for himself. And his food-cow may go with the lord’s oxen.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[12] Be oxanhyrde. Oxanhyrde mot læswian II oxan oððe ma mid hlafordes heorde on gemænre læse be his ealdormannes gewitnesse; earnian mid ðam scos 7 glofa him sylfum. [12.1] 7 his metecu mot gan mid hlafordes oxan.</ab>
      </div>
